    {
      "hash": "a9c969d423bd4bf23a986c4115f1e17f",
      "translation": "# Style Guide\n\nThis directory contains the code and documentation style guidelines for the ErisPulse project."
    },
    {
      "hash": "6774ad62931ef9fcedef2253d670031f",
      "translation": "## Documentation List\n\n- [Docstring Style Guide](docstring.md) - Format guidelines for method docstrings and documentation strings"
    },
    {
      "hash": "5e96064bfe736def571882ab2221b786",
      "translation": "## Audience\n\nThese documents are suitable for the following developers:\n\n- ErisPulse core contributors\n- Module and adapter developers\n- Developers who need to generate API documentation"
    },
    {
      "hash": "d22a1241f0f7871b3c00c197b08801df",
      "translation": "## Purpose\n\nThe purpose of the style guide:\n\n- Ensure consistency in code comments\n- Support automatic API documentation generation\n- Improve code readability and maintainability"
    },
    {
      "hash": "7d20269d5fa16cabaefcddd10e4cc0e5",
      "translation": "## Benefits of Following Standards\n\n- Consistent code style  \n- Comprehensive API documentation  \n- Better team collaboration  \n- Support for automated documentation generation"
    },
    {
      "hash": "400b11aacd455871332cf4d7d312162c",
      "translation": "## Related Documentation\n\n- [Developer Guide](../developer-guide/) - Develop custom modules and adapters\n- [Technical Standards](../standards/) - Framework technical specifications"
    }
  ]
}